 of the race, Regazzoni charged into the lead, but was repassed by team-mate Jones and Jabouille before the end of the first lap.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":4,"text":"At the end of lap 2, Piquet made a mistake at Woodcote and spun off, before Andretti dropped out with a broken wheel bearing on lap 4.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":23},{"lap":17,"text":"However, disaster struck for Jabouille when, after a long stop, part of his front wing got caught in an air hose that had not been removed from under the car and was broken off as he accelerated.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":20},{"lap":39,"text":"Then, approaching Woodcote at the end of lap 39, Jones's engine failed, a water pump problem causing it to overheat.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":17},{"lap":68,"text":"Regazzoni eventually took the chequered flag 24 seconds ahead of Arnoux, giving Williams their first Formula One victory.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}